    },
    "Age": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Věk"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alter"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Age"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edad"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Âge"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Età"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "อายุ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年龄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Age sets the heart-rate range every session is measured against. Sessions a week and how long you have been training set your training level, which both tiers use. Ready again after shapes your Recharge+ estimate until there is enough history to answer for itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Věk určuje rozsah tepové frekvence, vůči kterému se každý trénink měří. Počet tréninků týdně a doba, po kterou trénuješ, určují tvou tréninkovou úroveň, kterou využívají obě verze. Údaj Znovu připraveno po ovlivňuje tvůj odhad v Recharge+, dokud nebude dost historie, aby odhad vystačil sám."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Alter legt den Herzfrequenzbereich fest, an dem jede Einheit gemessen wird. Einheiten pro Woche und die Dauer deines Trainings bestimmen dein Trainingsniveau, das beide Stufen nutzen. „Wieder bereit nach“ prägt deine Recharge+-Schätzung, bis genug Verlauf vorhanden ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Age sets the heart-rate range every session is measured against. Sessions a week and how long you have been training set your training level, which both tiers use. Ready again after shapes your Recharge+ estimate until there is enough history to answer for itself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La edad define el rango de frecuencia cardiaca con el que se mide cada sesión. Las sesiones por semana y el tiempo que llevas entrenando definen tu nivel de entrenamiento, que usan ambos niveles. «Listo de nuevo tras» da forma a tu estimación de Recharge+ hasta que haya historial suficiente para responder por sí misma."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’âge définit la plage de fréquence cardiaque à laquelle chaque séance est comparée. Le nombre de séances par semaine et ton ancienneté d’entraînement déterminent ton niveau d’entraînement, utilisé par les deux offres. « De nouveau prêt après » oriente ton estimation Recharge+ jusqu’à ce que l’historique soit suffisant."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'età definisce l'intervallo di frequenza cardiaca con cui viene misurata ogni sessione. Le sessioni a settimana e da quanto tempo ti alleni definiscono il tuo livello di allenamento, usato da entrambe le versioni. \"Di nuovo pronto dopo\" influenza la tua stima Recharge+ finché non c'è abbastanza storico per fare da sé."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "อายุกำหนดช่วงอัตราการเต้นของหัวใจที่ใช้เทียบกับทุกเซสชัน จำนวนเซสชันต่อสัปดาห์และระยะเวลาที่ฝึกมากำหนดระดับการฝึก ซึ่งใช้ทั้งสองระดับ ส่วนคำตอบว่าพร้อมอีกครั้งหลังเท่าไรใช้กำหนดค่าประมาณ Recharge+ จนกว่าจะมีประวัติเพียงพอ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "年龄决定每次训练所参照的心率范围。每周训练次数和训练年限决定你的训练水平，免费版和 Recharge+ 都会使用。“再次就绪需要”会影响 Recharge+ 的估算，直到积累足够的历史数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Age, from your Health profile": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Věk z tvého profilu Health"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alter, aus deinem Health-Profil"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
