    "Recharge could not delete its local data. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge se nepodařilo smazat místní data. Zkus to znovu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge konnte seine lokalen Daten nicht löschen. Versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge could not delete its local data. Try again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge no pudo eliminar sus datos locales. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge n’a pas pu supprimer ses données locales. Réessaie."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge non è riuscito a eliminare i dati locali. Riprova."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ลบข้อมูลในเครื่องไม่ได้ ลองอีกครั้ง"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 无法删除本地数据。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge could not request access. Open the Health app, choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge se nepodařilo požádat o přístup. Otevři aplikaci Health, vyber Sdílení, Aplikace a pak Recharge."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge konnte den Zugriff nicht anfragen. Öffne die Health-App, wähle Teilen, dann Apps, dann Recharge."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge could not request access. Open the Health app, choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge no pudo solicitar el acceso. Abre la app Health y elige Compartir, luego Apps y después Recharge."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge n’a pas pu demander l’accès. Ouvre l’app Health, touche Partage, puis Apps, puis Recharge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge non è riuscito a richiedere l'accesso. Apri l'app Health, scegli Condivisione, poi App, poi Recharge."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ขอสิทธิ์เข้าถึงไม่ได้ เปิดแอป Health แล้วไปที่การแชร์ > แอป > Recharge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 无法请求访问权限。请打开 Health App，依次选择“共享”、“App”、Recharge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge couldn't read Apple Health. Connect again, then try another read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge se nepodařilo načíst data z Apple Health. Propoj se znovu a zkus načtení zopakovat."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge konnte Apple Health nicht lesen. Verbinde erneut und versuche es dann noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge couldn't read Apple Health. Connect again, then try another read."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge no pudo leer Apple Health. Conéctalo de nuevo y vuelve a intentar la lectura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge n’a pas pu lire Apple Health. Reconnecte-la, puis relance une lecture."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge non è riuscito a leggere Apple Health. Collegalo di nuovo, poi riprova."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge อ่าน Apple Health ไม่ได้ เชื่อมต่ออีกครั้ง แล้วลองอ่านใหม่"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 无法读取 Apple Health。请重新连接，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge couldn't request access. Open the Health app and choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge se nepodařilo požádat o přístup. Otevři aplikaci Health a vyber Sdílení, Aplikace a pak Recharge."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge konnte den Zugriff nicht anfragen. Öffne die Health-App und wähle Teilen, dann Apps, dann Recharge."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge couldn't request access. Open the Health app and choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge no pudo solicitar el acceso. Abre la app Health y elige Compartir, luego Apps y después Recharge."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge n’a pas pu demander l’accès. Ouvre l’app Health, touche Partage, puis Apps, puis Recharge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge non è riuscito a richiedere l'accesso. Apri l'app Health e scegli Condivisione, poi App, poi Recharge."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ขอสิทธิ์เข้าถึงไม่ได้ เปิดแอป Health แล้วไปที่การแชร์ > แอป > Recharge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 无法请求访问权限。请打开 Health App，依次选择“共享”、“App”、Recharge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge decides": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rozhoduje Recharge"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge entscheidet"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge decides"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge decide"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge décide"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge decide"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ให้ Recharge กำหนด"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 Recharge 决定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge estimates a training-load recovery window from your recent workouts. It is not a measure of muscle repair, illness, injury risk, or whether you are fit to train, and it is not medical advice. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge odhaduje okno regenerace podle tréninkové zátěže z tvých posledních tréninků. Neměří obnovu svalů, nemoc, riziko zranění ani to, zda je pro tebe trénink vhodný, a není lékařskou radou. Před zdravotními rozhodnutími se poraď s kvalifikovaným zdravotnickým odborníkem."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge schätzt anhand deiner letzten Workouts ein Erholungsfenster nach der Trainingsbelastung. Es misst weder Muskelregeneration noch Krankheit oder Verletzungsrisiko und sagt nicht aus, ob du trainingsfähig bist. Es ist keine medizinische Beratung. Sprich vor medizinischen Entscheidungen mit einer qualifizierten Fachperson."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge estimates a training-load recovery window from your recent workouts. It is not a measure of muscle repair, illness, injury risk, or whether you are fit to train, and it is not medical advice. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge estima una ventana de recuperación a partir de la carga de tus entrenamientos recientes. No mide la reparación muscular, las enfermedades, el riesgo de lesión ni si estás en condiciones de entrenar, y no es un consejo médico. Habla con un profesional sanitario cualificado antes de tomar decisiones médicas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge estime une fenêtre de récupération liée à la charge d’entraînement, à partir de tes entraînements récents. Ce n’est pas une mesure de la réparation musculaire, d’une maladie, d’un risque de blessure ni de ton aptitude à t’entraîner, et ce n’est pas un avis médical. Parle à un professionnel de santé qualifié avant de prendre toute décision médicale."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge stima una finestra di recupero legata al carico di allenamento in base ai tuoi allenamenti recenti. Non misura la riparazione muscolare, le malattie, il rischio di infortuni né se sei in condizione di allenarti, e non è un consiglio medico. Parla con un professionista sanitario qualificato prima di prendere decisioni mediche."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ประเมินช่วงการฟื้นตัวตามภาระการฝึกจากการออกกำลังกายล่าสุดของคุณ ไม่ใช่การวัดการซ่อมแซมของกล้ามเนื้อ อาการเจ็บป่วย ความเสี่ยงต่อการบาดเจ็บ หรือความเหมาะสมที่จะฝึก และไม่ใช่คำแนะนำทางการแพทย์ ควรปรึกษาผู้เชี่ยวชาญด้านสุขภาพที่มีคุณวุฒิก่อนตัดสินใจเรื่องทางการแพทย์"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 会根据你近期的体能训练，估算训练负荷的恢复时间。它不能衡量肌肉修复、疾病、受伤风险或你是否适合训练，也不是医疗建议。做出医疗决定前，请咨询合格的健康专业人士。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge poskytuje odhad kardiovaskulární tréninkové zátěže z tvých dat v Apple Health. Nejde o lékařskou radu a neslouží k diagnostice, léčbě ani prevenci žádného onemocnění. Před zdravotními rozhodnutími se poraď s kvalifikovaným zdravotnickým odborníkem."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge liefert aus deinen Daten in Apple Health eine Schätzung zum Herz-Kreislauf-Training. Sie ist keine medizinische Beratung und stellt keine Diagnose, behandelt keine Erkrankung und beugt auch keiner vor. Sprich vor medizinischen Entscheidungen mit einer qualifizierten Fachperson."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ofrece una estimación de entrenamiento cardiovascular a partir de tus datos de Apple Health. No es un consejo médico y no diagnostica, trata ni previene ninguna afección. Habla con un profesional sanitario cualificado antes de tomar decisiones médicas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge fournit une estimation d’entraînement cardiovasculaire à partir de tes données Apple Health. Ce n’est pas un avis médical et cela ne permet ni de diagnostiquer, ni de traiter, ni de prévenir une affection. Parle à un professionnel de santé qualifié avant de prendre toute décision médicale."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge fornisce una stima di allenamento cardiovascolare basata sui tuoi dati di Apple Health. Non è un consiglio medico e non diagnostica, non tratta e non previene alcuna condizione. Parla con un professionista sanitario qualificato prima di prendere decisioni mediche."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ให้ค่าประมาณด้านการฝึกระบบหัวใจและหลอดเลือดจากข้อมูล Apple Health ของคุณ ไม่ใช่คำแนะนำทางการแพทย์ และไม่ได้วินิจฉัย รักษา หรือป้องกันภาวะใดๆ ควรปรึกษาผู้เชี่ยวชาญด้านสุขภาพที่มีคุณวุฒิก่อนตัดสินใจเรื่องทางการแพทย์"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 根据你的 Apple Health 数据给出心血管训练估算。它不是医疗建议，也不会诊断、治疗或预防任何病症。做出医疗决定前，请咨询合格的健康专业人士。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions. Your Health data stays on your devices; only purchase information is handled by Apple and RevenueCat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge poskytuje odhad kardiovaskulární tréninkové zátěže z tvých dat v Apple Health. Nejde o lékařskou radu a neslouží k diagnostice, léčbě ani prevenci žádného onemocnění. Před zdravotními rozhodnutími se poraď s kvalifikovaným zdravotnickým odborníkem. Tvá data z Health zůstávají na tvých zařízeních; údaje o nákupech zpracovávají pouze Apple a RevenueCat."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge liefert aus deinen Daten in Apple Health eine Schätzung zum Herz-Kreislauf-Training. Sie ist keine medizinische Beratung und stellt keine Diagnose, behandelt keine Erkrankung und beugt auch keiner vor. Sprich vor medizinischen Entscheidungen mit einer qualifizierten Fachperson. Deine Health-Daten bleiben auf deinen Geräten; nur Kaufinformationen werden von Apple und RevenueCat verarbeitet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge gives a cardiovascular training estimate from your Apple Health data. It is not medical advice and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Talk with a qualified health professional before making medical decisions. Your Health data stays on your devices; only purchase information is handled by Apple and RevenueCat."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ofrece una estimación de entrenamiento cardiovascular a partir de tus datos de Apple Health. No es un consejo médico y no diagnostica, trata ni previene ninguna afección. Habla con un profesional sanitario cualificado antes de tomar decisiones médicas. Tus datos de Health se quedan en tus dispositivos; solo la información de compra la gestionan Apple y RevenueCat."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge fournit une estimation d’entraînement cardiovasculaire à partir de tes données Apple Health. Ce n’est pas un avis médical et cela ne permet ni de diagnostiquer, ni de traiter, ni de prévenir une affection. Parle à un professionnel de santé qualifié avant de prendre toute décision médicale. Tes données Health restent sur tes appareils ; seules les informations d’achat sont gérées par Apple et RevenueCat."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge fornisce una stima di allenamento cardiovascolare basata sui tuoi dati di Apple Health. Non è un consiglio medico e non diagnostica, non tratta e non previene alcuna condizione. Parla con un professionista sanitario qualificato prima di prendere decisioni mediche. I tuoi dati di Health restano sui tuoi dispositivi; solo le informazioni di acquisto sono gestite da Apple e RevenueCat."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ให้ค่าประมาณด้านการฝึกระบบหัวใจและหลอดเลือดจากข้อมูล Apple Health ของคุณ ไม่ใช่คำแนะนำทางการแพทย์ และไม่ได้วินิจฉัย รักษา หรือป้องกันภาวะใดๆ ควรปรึกษาผู้เชี่ยวชาญด้านสุขภาพที่มีคุณวุฒิก่อนตัดสินใจเรื่องทางการแพทย์ ข้อมูล Health ของคุณอยู่ในอุปกรณ์ของคุณเท่านั้น มีเพียงข้อมูลการซื้อที่ Apple และ RevenueCat ดูแล"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 根据你的 Apple Health 数据给出心血管训练估算。它不是医疗建议，也不会诊断、治疗或预防任何病症。做出医疗决定前，请咨询合格的健康专业人士。你的 Health 数据保留在你的设备上；只有购买信息由 Apple 和 RevenueCat 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
