    },
    "Recharge keeps counting down in the background and tells you the moment the countdown runs out, so you never have to open the app to find out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge odpočítává na pozadí a upozorní tě ve chvíli, kdy odpočet skončí, takže aplikaci nemusíš otevírat."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge zählt im Hintergrund weiter herunter und meldet sich, sobald der Countdown abläuft. Du musst die App dafür nicht öffnen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge keeps counting down in the background and tells you the moment the countdown runs out, so you never have to open the app to find out."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge sigue con la cuenta atrás en segundo plano y te avisa en cuanto termina, así no tienes que abrir la app para saberlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge poursuit le compte à rebours en arrière-plan et te prévient dès qu’il arrive à zéro, sans que tu aies à ouvrir l’app."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge prosegue il conto alla rovescia in background e ti avvisa nel momento in cui finisce, così non devi aprire l'app per scoprirlo."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge นับถอยหลังต่อในเบื้องหลังและแจ้งคุณทันทีที่การนับถอยหลังสิ้นสุด คุณจึงไม่ต้องเปิดแอปเพื่อดู"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 会在后台持续倒计时，并在倒计时结束的那一刻通知你，无需打开 App 查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge needs workout access before it can start a countdown. You can connect now, or manage access later in the Health app under Sharing, then Apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro spuštění odpočtu potřebuje Recharge přístup k tréninkům. Propojit můžeš hned, nebo přístup později spravovat v aplikaci Health v části Sdílení, Aplikace."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge braucht Zugriff auf Workouts, bevor ein Countdown starten kann. Du kannst Apple Health jetzt verbinden oder den Zugriff später in der Health-App unter Teilen und dann Apps verwalten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge needs workout access before it can start a countdown. You can connect now, or manage access later in the Health app under Sharing, then Apps."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge necesita acceso a los entrenamientos para poder iniciar una cuenta atrás. Puedes conectarlo ahora o gestionar el acceso más tarde en la app Health, en Compartir y después Apps."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge a besoin d’accéder à tes entraînements pour lancer un compte à rebours. Tu peux te connecter maintenant ou gérer l’accès plus tard dans l’app Health, sous Partage, puis Apps."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ha bisogno dell'accesso agli allenamenti per avviare un conto alla rovescia. Puoi collegarti ora oppure gestire l'accesso in seguito nell'app Health, in Condivisione, poi App."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ต้องได้รับสิทธิ์เข้าถึงการออกกำลังกายก่อนจึงจะเริ่มการนับถอยหลังได้ คุณเชื่อมต่อได้ตอนนี้ หรือจัดการสิทธิ์ภายหลังในแอป Health ที่การแชร์ > แอป"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 需要获得体能训练的访问权限，才能开始倒计时。你可以现在连接，也可以稍后在 Health App 中依次选择“共享”、“App”来管理访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge only reads Health data. Apple keeps individual read permissions private, so Recharge can report what it receives but never which categories you allowed. Review them in the Health app under Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge data z Health jen čte. Apple drží jednotlivá oprávnění ke čtení v soukromí, takže Recharge umí uvést, co dostává, ale nikdy ne to, které kategorie jsou povolené. Zkontroluj je v aplikaci Health v části Sdílení, Aplikace, Recharge."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge greift nur lesend auf Health-Daten zu. Apple hält einzelne Leseberechtigungen privat, daher kann Recharge melden, was es erhält, aber nie, welche Kategorien du erlaubt hast. Prüfe sie in der Health-App unter Teilen, dann Apps, dann Recharge."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge only reads Health data. Apple keeps individual read permissions private, so Recharge can report what it receives but never which categories you allowed. Review them in the Health app under Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge solo lee datos de Health. Apple mantiene privados los permisos de lectura individuales, así que Recharge puede indicar lo que recibe, pero nunca qué categorías has permitido. Revísalas en la app Health, en Compartir, luego Apps y después Recharge."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ne fait que lire les données Health. Apple garde confidentielles les autorisations de lecture individuelles : Recharge peut indiquer ce qu’elle reçoit, mais jamais les catégories que tu as autorisées. Consulte-les dans l’app Health, sous Partage, puis Apps, puis Recharge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge legge soltanto i dati di Health. Apple mantiene private le singole autorizzazioni di lettura, quindi Recharge può indicare ciò che riceve ma non quali categorie hai consentito. Controllale nell'app Health, in Condivisione, poi App, poi Recharge."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge อ่านข้อมูล Health เท่านั้น Apple เก็บสิทธิ์การอ่านรายหมวดเป็นความลับ Recharge จึงรายงานได้เฉพาะข้อมูลที่ได้รับ แต่ไม่ทราบว่าคุณอนุญาตหมวดใดบ้าง ตรวจสอบได้ในแอป Health ที่การแชร์ > แอป > Recharge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 只读取 Health 数据。Apple 会将各项读取权限保密，因此 Recharge 只能报告它收到了什么，无法得知你允许了哪些类别。请在 Health App 中依次选择“共享”、“App”、Recharge 查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge read this as %@ from %@. Change it and the countdown is recalculated from your answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge to vyhodnotil jako %1$@ (zdroj: %2$@). Změň to a odpočet se přepočítá podle tvé odpovědi."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge hat dies als %@ aus %@ gelesen. Ändere es, und der Countdown wird anhand deiner Angabe neu berechnet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge read this as %@ from %@. Change it and the countdown is recalculated from your answer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge lo ha leído como %@ a partir de %@. Cámbialo y la cuenta atrás se recalcula con tu respuesta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge a lu %@ depuis %@. Modifie la valeur et le compte à rebours sera recalculé d’après ta réponse."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge l'ha letto come %@ da %@. Modificalo e il conto alla rovescia viene ricalcolato in base alla tua risposta."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge อ่านค่านี้เป็น %@ จาก %@ หากเปลี่ยนค่า การนับถอยหลังจะคำนวณใหม่ตามคำตอบของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 读取到的是 %@，来源：%@。修改后，倒计时会根据你的回答重新计算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge read your age and your weekly volume from Apple Health.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tvůj věk a týdenní objem tréninků pocházejí z Apple Health."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge hat dein Alter und dein Wochenvolumen aus Apple Health gelesen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge read your age and your weekly volume from Apple Health."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ha leído tu edad y tu volumen semanal de Apple Health."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge a lu ton âge et ton volume hebdomadaire dans Apple Health."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ha letto la tua età e il tuo volume settimanale da Apple Health."
          }
        },
        "th": {
