    "Recharge reads the time you spent at each heart rate, so hard repeats cost more than a steady run at the same average, and a long easy ride no longer outweighs a hard hour.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge zohledňuje čas strávený při jednotlivých tepových frekvencích, takže náročné intervaly víc zatíží než plynulý běh při stejném průměru a dlouhá lehká jízda už nepřebije náročnou hodinu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge liest die Zeit, die du bei jeder Herzfrequenz verbracht hast. So zählen intensive Intervalle mehr als ein gleichmäßiger Lauf mit demselben Durchschnitt, und eine lange, leichte Radtour wiegt nicht mehr schwerer als eine intensive Stunde."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge reads the time you spent at each heart rate, so hard repeats cost more than a steady run at the same average, and a long easy ride no longer outweighs a hard hour."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge lee el tiempo que pasas en cada frecuencia cardiaca, así que las repeticiones intensas pesan más que una carrera constante con la misma media, y una salida larga y suave ya no pesa más que una hora intensa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge lit le temps passé à chaque fréquence cardiaque : des répétitions intenses pèsent plus qu’une course régulière à la même moyenne, et une longue sortie à vélo légère ne l’emporte plus sur une heure intense."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge legge il tempo trascorso a ogni frequenza cardiaca, così le ripetute intense pesano più di una corsa costante con la stessa media, e un lungo giro leggero in bici non supera più un'ora intensa."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge อ่านเวลาที่คุณอยู่ในแต่ละระดับอัตราการเต้นของหัวใจ การออกกำลังกายแบบหนักซ้ำๆ จึงนับเป็นภาระมากกว่าการวิ่งสม่ำเสมอที่ค่าเฉลี่ยเท่ากัน และการปั่นจักรยานเบาๆ นานๆ จะไม่นับมากกว่าหนึ่งชั่วโมงที่หนักอีกต่อไป"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 会读取你在各个心率下停留的时间，因此在平均值相同的情况下，高强度重复训练比匀速跑计入更多，长时间轻松骑行也不再比一小时高强度训练算得更重。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recharge still could not read Apple Health. Open the Health app, choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge se stále nepodařilo načíst Apple Health. Otevři aplikaci Health, vyber Sdílení, Aplikace a pak Recharge."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge konnte Apple Health weiterhin nicht lesen. Öffne die Health-App, wähle Teilen, dann Apps, dann Recharge."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge still could not read Apple Health. Open the Health app, choose Sharing, then Apps, then Recharge."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge sigue sin poder leer Apple Health. Abre la app Health y elige Compartir, luego Apps y después Recharge."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge n’arrive toujours pas à lire Apple Health. Ouvre l’app Health, touche Partage, puis Apps, puis Recharge."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge non è ancora riuscito a leggere Apple Health. Apri l'app Health, scegli Condivisione, poi App, poi Recharge."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge ยังอ่าน Apple Health ไม่ได้ เปิดแอป Health แล้วไปที่การแชร์ > แอป > Recharge"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recharge 仍然无法读取 Apple Health。请打开 Health App，依次选择“共享”、“App”、Recharge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
