          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Erholungsfenster sind etwa %lld%% kürzer als die Standardschätzung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your windows run about %lld%% shorter than the standard estimate."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus ventanas duran en torno a un %lld%% menos que la estimación estándar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes durées de récupération sont environ %lld %% plus courtes que l'estimation standard."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tuoi tempi di recupero sono circa il %lld%% più brevi della stima standard."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ช่วงเวลาของคุณสั้นกว่าค่าประมาณมาตรฐานประมาณ %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的恢复时间比标准估算短约 %lld%%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your workout": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tvůj trénink"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Workout"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your workout"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu entrenamiento"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton entraînement"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo allenamento"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การออกกำลังกายของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的体能训练"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your workouts and heart rate build the estimate. Your own highest heart rate sets the range intensity is measured against. Sleep, resting heart rate, HRV, breathing rate, cardio fitness, and weight sharpen it. Nothing is written back, and your Health data never leaves your devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odhad vychází z tvých tréninků a tepové frekvence. Tvoje vlastní nejvyšší tepová frekvence určuje rozsah, vůči kterému se měří intenzita. Spánek, klidová tepová frekvence, HRV, dechová frekvence, kardiovaskulární kondice a hmotnost ho zpřesňují. Nic se nezapisuje zpět a tvá data z Health nikdy neopustí tvá zařízení."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Workouts und deine Herzfrequenz bilden die Grundlage der Schätzung. Deine eigene maximale Herzfrequenz legt den Bereich fest, an dem die Intensität gemessen wird. Schlaf, Ruhepuls, HRV, Atemfrequenz, Cardio-Fitness und Gewicht machen sie genauer. Es wird nichts zurückgeschrieben, und deine Health-Daten verlassen nie deine Geräte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your workouts and heart rate build the estimate. Your own highest heart rate sets the range intensity is measured against. Sleep, resting heart rate, HRV, breathing rate, cardio fitness, and weight sharpen it. Nothing is written back, and your Health data never leaves your devices."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus entrenamientos y tu frecuencia cardiaca sirven para calcular la estimación. Tu frecuencia cardiaca más alta fija el rango con el que se mide la intensidad. El sueño, la frecuencia cardiaca en reposo, la VFC, la frecuencia respiratoria, la capacidad cardiovascular y el peso la afinan. No se escriben datos en Health y tus datos de Health nunca salen de tus dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes entraînements et ta fréquence cardiaque servent à établir l'estimation. Ta fréquence cardiaque maximale définit la plage sur laquelle l'intensité est mesurée. Le sommeil, la fréquence cardiaque au repos, la VFC, la fréquence respiratoire, la forme cardio et le poids l'affinent. Rien n'est réécrit dans Health, et tes données Health ne quittent jamais tes appareils."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tuoi allenamenti e la tua frequenza cardiaca costruiscono la stima. La tua frequenza cardiaca massima definisce l'intervallo rispetto a cui si misura l'intensità. Sonno, frequenza cardiaca a riposo, HRV, frequenza respiratoria, fitness cardio e peso la rendono più precisa. Nulla viene scritto in Health e i tuoi dati di Health non lasciano mai i tuoi dispositivi."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "การออกกำลังกายและอัตราการเต้นของหัวใจของคุณใช้สร้างค่าประมาณ อัตราการเต้นของหัวใจสูงสุดของคุณเองกำหนดช่วงที่ใช้วัดความหนัก การนอนหลับ อัตราการเต้นของหัวใจขณะพัก HRV อัตราการหายใจ สมรรถภาพหัวใจ และน้ำหนักช่วยให้ค่าประมาณแม่นยำขึ้น ระบบจะไม่เขียนข้อมูลกลับ และข้อมูล Health ของคุณจะไม่ออกจากอุปกรณ์ของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估算基于你的体能训练和心率。你自己的最高心率决定衡量强度所依据的范围。睡眠、静息心率、心率变异性、呼吸频率、心肺适能和体重会让估算更精准。我们不会写回任何数据，你的 Health 数据也不会离开你的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
